<title>UK: Crediop unit sets 10 billion Greek drachma FRN.</title>
<headline>Crediop unit sets 10 billion Greek drachma FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers San Paolo and SBC Warburg</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIOP OVERSEAS BANK LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  CREDIOP SPA</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN GRD    BASE	3M-ATHIBOR MATURITY	.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    -80 BP     PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE PAR	  FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER   PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/GR/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
